:: win BG [autosave] {"position":"400,3000","size":"100,100"}
You killed the boulder guardian and won the battle, gaining <<print ($mobLvl * 1.5 + $mobXP).toFixed(0)>> XP and $mobCoins Coins<<if $lootchance lte 25>> and iron.<<elseif $lootchance lte 35>> and 2 iron.<<elseif $lootchance lte 40>>and 4 iron.<<elseif $lootchance lte 100>>.<</if>>
<<EventCurrencies>>\
<<link "Go back">>
	<<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
	<<set $killedBG += 1>>
	<<MobRewards>>
    <<if $lootchance lte 25>>
		<<set $iron += 1>>
	<<elseif $lootchance lte 35>>
    	<<set $iron += 2>>
    <<elseif $lootchance lte 40>>
    	<<set $iron += 4>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>


